2026-08-25T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-1029) 'The Optimized-Tris-to-Quads-Converter is a Blender add-on, and Blender
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-1029) 'is blocklisted with no exemption. Its algorithm needs no host: an
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-1029) 'interior edge shared by exactly two triangles is a candidate to
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-1029) 'dissolve, each triangle may be dissolved at most once, and the goal is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-1029) 'to dissolve as many as possible, which is a matching on the dual
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:04Z (RFD66606-1029) 'graph. It now lives in `character-fox/Tools/rig/tris_to_quads.py`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-1029) 'with the PuLP formulation carried across unchanged and an exact
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-1029) 'matching solver beside it as a cross-check.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:07Z (RFD66606-1029) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-1029) 'The add-on delegated the dissolve to its host, and that is the part
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:09Z (RFD66606-1029) 'with teeth. Pairs are refused before the solver sees them when the two
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:10Z (RFD66606-1029) 'triangles disagree on facing, fold past 40 degrees, would merge into a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:11Z (RFD66606-1029) 'concave quad, or would leave a sliver corner. A bent or concave quad
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:12Z (RFD66606-1029) 'is triangulated back along the other diagonal, so the silhouette moves
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:13Z (RFD66606-1029) 'and nothing reports it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:14Z (RFD66606-1029) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:15Z (RFD66606-1029) '`jp.lilxyzw.ndmfmeshsimplifier` is blocklisted separately. It is a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:16Z (RFD66606-1029) 'capable quadric decimator that preserves shapes, but it runs at build
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:17Z (RFD66606-1029) 'time, so the mesh that ships is not the mesh in the scene.
