2026-08-25T00:01:44Z (RFD66606-1029) 'Measured 2026-09-12 on Miroir-Re: 647 shapes across ten meshes. Two
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:45Z (RFD66606-1029) 'structural facts make this the easiest possible transfer case. Every
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:46Z (RFD66606-1029) 'shape is single-frame, so there are no in-betweens to interpolate, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-1029) 'not one carries normal or tangent deltas, so only positions move.
 # tags: rfd:details
