 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:50Z (RFD66606-1029) 'median 5.10% of its vertices; BaseBody's 31 move 2.06%; the debug
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:51Z (RFD66606-1029) 'mesh's 113 move 0.91%, which on 440 vertices is four vertices. Ear and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:52Z (RFD66606-1029) 'Tail are the exception at 100%, being whole-mesh squashes.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:53Z (RFD66606-1029) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:54Z (RFD66606-1029) 'That suggests a strategy: protect the vertices a shape touches and
 # tags: rfd:details
