2026-08-25T00:02:11Z (RFD66606-1029) 'The conclusion is to avoid the transfer, not to write it
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:12Z (RFD66606-1029) 'Cardigan and Dress_frill carry one shape each and are 97.8% and 88.1%
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:13Z (RFD66606-1029) 'untouched, which makes them decimatable as if they were shape-free.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:14Z (RFD66606-1029) 'Adding them to the seven genuinely shape-free meshes gives 31,834
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:15Z (RFD66606-1029) 'triangles to work with against a deficit of 8,154, a 25.6% reduction,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:16Z (RFD66606-1029) 'where the shape-free meshes alone needed 47.2%. Hair adds another
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:17Z (RFD66606-1029) '8,944 at 45.6% free if that is not enough.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1029  1 LINE
 Text:Written

